# baseline vs v1

17 tasks in both runs. Metric: task_complete.

| | baseline | v1 | change |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| tasks complete | 16.0/17 (94%) | 15.5/17 (91%) | -0.5 |
| latency per task (s) | 30.8 | 28.3 | -8% |
| model calls per task | 6.3 | 6.0 | -5% |
| input tokens per task | 15,377 | 15,832 | +3% |
| output tokens per task | 1,774 | 1,611 | -9% |

## Tasks that changed

| task | baseline | v1 | tags |
| --- | ---: | ---: | --- |
| t01 | 2/2 | 1/2 | orders+shipping |

## Paths that changed

Reps of a task in which an agent was called. A task can keep its score and still take a different route.

| task | agent | baseline | v1 |
| --- | --- | ---: | ---: |
| t10 | orders | 0/2 | 2/2 |
| t16 | diagnostics | 2/2 | 0/2 |

One rep apart, which the unchanged system often does by itself: t01 (shipping), t05 (orders), t07 (orders), t15 (orders).

